OL,3,GNEWSA'Social supermarket' to take over
OL,4,Avacant shop
OL,5,
OL,6,FA "social supermarket" offering
OL,7,Flow-cost food and support to escape
OL,8,Ffinancial hardship is to open at a
OL,9,Fthird location in Kent.
OL,11,FSE Kitchen is due to open at the
OL,12,FPentagon Shopping Centre in Chatham in
OL,13,FOctober, adding to branches in Ashford
OL,14,Fand Ramsgate.
OL,16,FThe food shops, run by Social
OL,17,FEnterprise Kent, redistribute surplus
OL,18,Ffood and offer cut-price groceries.
OL,23,APub: 26-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
FL,323,320,200,140,0,100
