OL,3,GNEWSA'Social supermarket' to take over
OL,4,Avacant shop
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe community interest company's chief
OL,7,Fexecutive, Rebecca Smith, said: "We
OL,8,Fpride ourselves on creating a
OL,9,Fsupportive, inclusive space where
OL,10,Fpeople can access what they need today
OL,11,Fwhile building a more stable,
OL,12,Fsustainable future."
